<title>USA: Western Resources extends offer for ADT.</title>
<headline>Western Resources extends offer for ADT.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kansas 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources Inc said Thursday it is extending the expiration date of its exchange offer for all the outstanding common shares of ADT Ltd to June 17.</p>
<p>As of 1700 EDT/2100 GMT on April 9, 51,793 common shares of ADT had been tendered, Western Resources said.  </p>
<p>Western Resources late last year made an unsolicited cash-and-stock offer for ADT that was valued at about $3.5 billion. ADT rejected that offer.</p>
<p>Earlier this year, Tyco International Ltd said it agreed to buy ADT for about $5.4 billion.</p>
<p>((--Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
